    "description": "The Identity Card App is software that you install on your smartphone/computer/tablet to identify yourself online with your ID card, your electronic residence permit or the eID card for Union citizens. \r\n\r\nAll further information can be found at www.kartenapp.bund.de\r\n\r\nCheck whether your mobile device is suitable: https://www.kartenapp.bund.de/mobile-geraete\r\n\r\nThe accessibility declaration for the software can be found at: https://www.kartenapp.bund.de/barrierfreiheit-app\r\n\r\nDeveloped on behalf of the Federal Office for Information Security.",
